98
00:08:38,990 --> 00:08:41,840
-多谢  -感谢你朋友波比·菲什吧
- I appreciate it. - Appreciate your friend Bobby Fish.

99
00:08:42,160 --> 00:08:44,330
我们都完成了不少工作
We all did some impressive book-cracking.

100
00:08:44,400 --> 00:08:46,920
而且  你在监狱困难时期
Plus, you made it through a prison stint

101
00:08:46,930 --> 00:08:48,380
没有动过粗
without throwing a single punch.

102
00:08:48,380 --> 00:08:49,940
我相信这不容易  考虑到你的...
I'm sure that was hard for a person with your...

103
00:08:49,940 --> 00:08:52,010
-我知道  -名声
- I know. - ...reputation.

104
00:08:52,300 --> 00:08:55,910
-克莱尔会来吗  -这里只有律师能进
- Is, uh... Claire coming? - It's lawyers only in here.

105
00:08:56,790 --> 00:08:59,530
那失陪  我还得去赶大巴
Well, if you'll excuse me, I have a bus to catch.

106
00:08:59,530 --> 00:09:02,650
当然  还有一件事
Of course. Uh, just one last thing.

107
00:09:03,380 --> 00:09:06,620
霍加斯-赵-班诺维茨事务所随时为您服务
The law firm of Hogarth, Chao & Benowitz is at your disposal.

108
00:09:06,860 --> 00:09:08,420
如果您需要重新开始
In case you need help starting over.

109
00:09:09,300 --> 00:09:11,000
我不会重新开始  尼尔森先生
I'm not starting over, Mr. Nelson.

110
00:09:12,100 --> 00:09:13,340
我要向前看
I'm moving forward.

111
00:09:14,140 --> 00:09:15,400
大家喊我福吉
People call me Foggy.

112
00:09:16,010 --> 00:09:16,910
你就默许了
