113
00:09:24,360 --> 00:09:26,410
您是公开声明  50街和10街交叉口的
You're on record as saying that the new subway station

114
00:09:26,410 --> 00:09:29,720
地铁站会是  "对社区有利的"
at 50th and 10th would be, quote, "Good for the community."

115
00:09:30,060 --> 00:09:33,510
会是...引述  "对社区有利的"
Would be quote-- quote, unquote, "Good for the community."

116
00:09:33,510 --> 00:09:36,920
博科威兹先生  以您专业...
Mr. Berkowitz, in your professional-

117
00:09:39,550 --> 00:09:40,510
你在干什么
What the hell are you doing?

118
00:09:40,590 --> 00:09:42,480
你干什么  看我爆了你的头
'Sup, man? I'll bust your goddamn head!

119
00:09:42,480 --> 00:09:44,690
-是吗  来啊  -想干什么
