122
00:09:52,620 --> 00:09:55,340
-你  人行道上的  -是  长官
- You, up on the sidewalk. - Yes, sir, officer.

123
00:09:59,090 --> 00:10:00,050
博科威兹先生
Mr. Berkowitz...

124
00:10:00,050 --> 00:10:02,740
以您专业的意见  这对亚伦·詹姆斯好吗
In your professional opinion, was it good for Aaron James?

125
00:10:02,740 --> 00:10:04,190
我们同情他们一家
Our sympathies go out to the family.

126
00:10:04,200 --> 00:10:05,790
但这件事  是个不幸
The whole thing... It's very unfortunate.

127
00:10:05,800 --> 00:10:07,680
您可知道您新地铁站用的产品
Were you aware the products used in your new station

128
00:10:07,680 --> 00:10:08,660
对儿童有害吗
were hazardous to children?

129
