-反对  -我重说
- Objection! - I'll rephrase.

130
00:10:10,020 --> 00:10:11,730
恩德萨本有什么优势
What was attractive about Endexoprene?

131
00:10:11,730 --> 00:10:13,440
强韧  持久
It's strong. It's durable.

132
00:10:13,450 --> 00:10:15,680
-价钱是别的一半  -我毕竟是做生意的
- And half the price? - Well, I do run a business.

133
00:10:16,200 --> 00:10:18,970
为了省钱  就值得危害别人吗
Is it worth endangering people in the interest of saving money?

134
00:10:19,850 --> 00:10:21,350
所有材料经过了测试
All materials are tested.

135
00:10:21,360 --> 00:10:22,840
那些发现一被公布
The moment those findings were made public,

136
00:10:22,840 --> 00:10:25,670
我们公司立刻换掉了其他所有站台的灰浆
our company replaced that mortar in all remaining stations.

137
00:10:25,670 --> 00:10:27,590
"一被公布"
"Made public."

138
00:10:30,040 --> 00:10:31,000
什么意思
What do you mean?

139
00:10:32,580 --> 00:10:35,610
你是指9月29日公布的一份报告吗
Are you referring to a report released on September 29th?

140
00:10:35,610 --> 00:10:36,870
法官大人  他在要求我的委托人
Your Honor, he's asking my client

141
00:10:36,870 --> 00:10:39,030
做出不合理的详尽回答
to respond with unreasonable specificity.

142
00:10:39,030 --> 00:10:40,660
博科威兹先生  如果我没记错
Mr. Berkowitz, if memory serves me right,

143
00:10:40,660 --> 00:10:42,120
您办公室于6月3日就收到了一份
your office received an urgent delivery

144
00:10:42,120 --> 00:10:44,200
来自安全委员会的急件
from the Safety Commission on June 3rd.

145
00:10:44,200 --> 00:10:45,160
那是三个月前
Three months earlier.

146
00:10:45,160 --> 00:10:47,360
我好奇  那是否跟恩德萨本有任何关系
I'm curious, did that have anything to do with Endexoprene?

147
