我毫不知情
I don't know anything about that.

148
00:10:48,330 --> 00:10:49,610
法官大人  默多克先生
Your Honor, unless Mr. Murdock

149
00:10:49,610 --> 00:10:50,620
若能证明我的委托人
can prove my client

150
00:10:50,620 --> 00:10:53,050
真的收到了这些假设存在的文件  那
actually received these hypothetical documents, then--

151
00:10:53,050 --> 00:10:54,080
重点不是收没收到
It's not about whether he received them.

152
00:10:54,090 --> 00:10:55,880
而是他是否有意无视了它
It's whether he willfully ignored them.

153
00:10:55,880 --> 00:10:57,330
法官大人  我要求将这份送达记录
Your Honor, I ask that this record of delivery

154
00:10:57,330 --> 00:10:58,560
收录证据
be admitted into evidence.

155
00:10:58,570 --> 00:11:01,380
-我经常收到这玩意  -哪样最糟
- I mean, I get a lot of those. - What would you say is worse?

156
00:11:01,610 --> 00:11:03,600
为节省成本而无视数据
Ignoring data in the interest of cutting costs?

157
00:11:03,610 --> 00:11:05,240
还是没有向法庭提交
Or neglecting to supply the court with records

158
00:11:05,240 --> 00:11:07,320
或许能证明你有意危及他人生命的证据
that might prove you purposely put people in danger?

159
00:11:07,320 --> 00:11:08,470
-包括这位年轻人  -法官大人
- Including this young man - Your Honor--

160
00:11:08,470 --> 00:11:09,490
包括这位年轻人
Including this young man,

161
00:11:09,490 --> 00:11:11,360
亚伦·詹姆斯  他可能再也无法走路
Aaron James, who might never walk again.

162
00:11:11,370 --> 00:11:13,250
法官大人  我们想请求休庭
Your Honor, we would like a recess.

163
00:11:13,250 --> 00:11:14,490
不需要  我说完了
No need. I'm done.

164
00:11:15,350 --> 00:11:16,610
我觉得他也完了
I think he is, too.

165
00:11:25,780 --> 00:11:28,440
一千一百万
$11 million!

166
00:11:29,290 --> 00:11:30,640
谢谢你  默多克先生
Thank you, Mr. Murdock.

167
00:11:30,650 --> 00:11:32,360
-不客气  -谢谢
- Oh, my pleasure. - Thank you.

168
00:11:32,760 --> 00:11:34,100
我很为你高兴
I'm so happy for you.

169
00:11:38,370 --> 00:11:39,350
天呐
God.

170
00:11:44,700 --> 00:11:46,870
-你还好吧  -嗯
- You okay? - Yeah.

171
00:11:53,190 --> 00:11:54,540
我能跟你说句话吗
Mind if I tell you something?

172
00:11:55,590 --> 00:11:56,380
当然
Sure.

173
00:11:59,560 --> 00:12:01,700
那钱对你父母会有很大帮助
That money is really gonna help your parents.

174
00:12:02,870 --> 00:12:04,500
但对于你  从今往后
But for you, from here on out...

175
00:12:05,260 --> 00:12:06,760
只会越来越难  亚伦
it's only gonna get harder, Aaron.

176
00:12:08,020 --> 00:12:10,580
要知道你现在是在马拉松的第一英里
You realize you're only at mile one of the marathon...

177
00:12:11,800 --> 00:12:12,700
你知道吧
right?

178
00:12:13,990 --> 00:12:15,830
每个人都会告诉你该有怎样的感受
Everybody's gonna tell you how to feel.

179
00:12:16,980 --> 00:12:18,520
医生会告诉你保持积极
Doctors are gonna tell you to stay positive.

180
00:12:18,520 --> 00:12:20,410
你的家人会告诉你不要自怨自艾
Your family's gonna tell you not to feel sorry for yourself.

181
00:12:20,410 --> 00:12:22,460
你的治疗师会告诉你别生气
Your therapist is gonna tell you not to be angry--

182
00:12:22,460 --> 00:12:24,030
我已经生气了
I'm already angry.

183
00:12:25,090 --> 00:12:25,970
气谁
At who?

184
00:12:29,040 --> 00:12:29,810
每一个人
Everyone.

185
00:12:32,080 --> 00:12:33,790
我只想要回我的生活
I just want my life back.

186
00:12:34,530 --> 00:12:35,720
那是别人给不了的
They can't give you that.

187
00:12:38,780 --> 00:12:39,890
或许你会再站起来
Maybe you'll walk again.

188
00:12:41,020 --> 00:12:41,820
我希望能
I hope so.

189
00:12:43,710 --> 00:12:44,810
但或许你不会
But maybe you won't.

190
00:12:46,130 --> 00:12:50,340
但随着生活越来越难  如果你还能撑下来
But your ability to get through it... as this gets harder...

191
00:12:51,510 --> 00:12:53,060
那比强颜欢笑
that is a hundred times more powerful

192
00:12:53,060 --> 00:12:54,710
假装一切都好
than slapping a smile on your face

193
00:12:54,710 --> 00:12:56,470
要强大千百倍
and pretending like everything's just fine.

194
00:12:59,080 --> 00:13:00,070
你明白吗
Do you understand?

195
00:13:04,210 --> 00:13:04,890
听着
Listen...

196
00:13:05,810 --> 00:13:07,880
没有人能把你的生活还给你  亚伦
no one can give you your life back, Aaron.

197
00:13:09,240 --> 00:13:11,690
