-我要我的钱  -我知道  会给你的
- I want my money. - I hear you. I'm gonna get it.

609
00:43:20,790 --> 00:43:22,780
给你到今天晚上
You got till the end of the day,

610
00:43:22,780 --> 00:43:24,840
